    "intro_html":  "Seared pork chops smothered in a creamy mushroom gravy over mashed potatoes. Steakhouse comfort at \u003cstrong\u003e40 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and 591 calories per plate, for about \u003cstrong\u003e$4.02\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). The gravy is built on the browned bits the chops leave behind, which is flavor you already paid for.",
